# Dev Notes 12 — runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1 native boundary coordinator

## Branch

`runtime-lifecycle-modularization-v1-native-boundary-coordinator`

## Status

Native-boundary coordinator slice staged and sandbox/mock verified.

This branch intentionally extracts only the parent-side native boundary / runtime-unhealthy helper cluster from `inference.mjs` into a small coordinator module.

It does not extract reset/session/shutdown coordinators, init coordinator behavior, worker protocol routing, scheduler ownership, request settlement, worker lifecycle ownership, or worker-local behavior.

