## Caveats preserved

Preserve awareness of prior non-blocking real-runtime caveats from the lifecycle state container handoff:

```text
one earlier context-creation cancel-boundary run hit a shutdown native timeout after the cancel assertion succeeded, later baseline/branch comparisons passed
one earlier init/reset orchestrator run produced an empty after-reset prompt assertion, immediate rerun passed
```

This branch does not attempt to patch those caveats because neither has been proven candidate-specific.

If either reappears during real-runtime verification, compare against the clean source/base and isolate the failing child mode before patching.

